(7562962, 1212658, 98565, '<td valign="top">LOL - I love that PoV, lots of humor and spoofing yourself! But I''m not sure if the North American majority of the voters will like it as much as I do.<br/> <br/>As I guess from the Italian newspaper this is either Alessandro''s or Alessio''s entry - in any case from an European photographer. Once I also had an entry involving a toilet scene and got not all too enthusiastic comments. So I''m already curious on the result of this one</td>', 'LOL - I love that PoV, lots of humor and spoofing yourself! But I''m not sure if the North American majority of the voters will like it as much as I do. As I guess from the Italian newspaper this is either Alessandro''s or Alessio''s entry - in any case from an European photographer. Once I also had an entry involving a toilet scene and got not all too enthusiastic comments. So I''m already curious on the result of this one', '2018-03-17 11:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
