(7563101, 1212622, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that fulfils the challenge brief well<br/> <br/>Bioluminescent fungi? I''ve never even heard of it let alone seen it! Is this the actual colour? If so its absolutely amazing. The viewpoint is, of course, absolutely the right one, the underside of these fungi are always attractively intriguing. Use of the focus stacking has paid off well with a good DOF for a nice sharp image where it matters, well done Chris, all in all, a most interesting image.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that fulfils the challenge brief well Bioluminescent fungi? I''ve never even heard of it let alone seen it! Is this the actual colour? If so its absolutely amazing. The viewpoint is, of course, absolutely the right one, the underside of these fungi are always attractively intriguing. Use of the focus stacking has paid off well with a good DOF for a nice sharp image where it matters, well done Chris, all in all, a most interesting image.', '2018-03-19 06:34:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7563102, 1212705, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that fulfils the challenge brief well<br/> <br/>Good timing and viewpoint Harrison. That one small part of the image nicely focused against a largely soft focus foreground work well, it draws your attention to her lovely smiling face. I like the mono presentation it adds emphasis to the critical part of the image. All in all a nice job, well done.<br/> <br/>I''ve only just noticed what a disappointingly low score you got, it deserved better than that, but thats DPC for you...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-03-19 06:40:09.</i></td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that fulfils the challenge brief well Good timing and viewpoint Harrison. That one small part of the image nicely focused against a largely soft focus foreground work well, it draws your attention to her lovely smiling face. I like the mono presentation it adds emphasis to the critical part of the image. All in all a nice job, well done. I''ve only just noticed what a disappointingly low score you got, it deserved better than that, but thats DPC for you...', '2018-03-19 06:38:31.000000', '2018-03-19 06:40:09.000000', 0),
